    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of <strong>Seth</strong>, god of the desert, on his quest to fight Apophis. In a game where Fast-FPS meets Rogue-Lite, battle waves of brutal enemies and ruthless bosses. <strong>Choose your weapon, fight, die, and rise again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/6007c7d2a5e10f96064b9cfe3b4e1dfa.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/6007c7d2a5e10f96064b9cfe3b4e1dfa.webm?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/6007c7d2a5e10f96064b9cfe3b4e1dfa.mp4?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/18201cf1c08a4e63f3445e2bfbeefd19.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/18201cf1c08a4e63f3445e2bfbeefd19.webp?t=1748078424\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span></h2></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into battle with a <strong>shield mechanic that encourages risk-taking</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay your foes, tear their soul apart from their body to replenish your shield and resist the most powerful attacks. But <strong>act quickly and stay close</strong> to them before they reach the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/08fc61e024dd3e11b2a5019351077e87.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/08fc61e024dd3e11b2a5019351077e87.webm?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/08fc61e024dd3e11b2a5019351077e87.mp4?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/7d8fc1cba4b2a5a4dd040bb7525a00b4.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/7d8fc1cba4b2a5a4dd040bb7525a00b4.webp?t=1748078424\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a selection of <strong>weapons with unique abilities</strong>, such as a slowdown for the bow or a grappling hook on your shotgun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them alongside your melee skills, dash, and spells to defeat your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/56ffd9979ce7f429d205abf85df551a1.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/56ffd9979ce7f429d205abf85df551a1.webm?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/56ffd9979ce7f429d205abf85df551a1.mp4?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/9701a84dfa3bb33bb3efa4e5b0cbbd43.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/9701a84dfa3bb33bb3efa4e5b0cbbd43.webp?t=1748078424\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span>Each god have their own style. <strong>Receive their powers, combine them</strong> and make each one of your run unique. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between two runs, restore your divinity to become the feared god you used to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/10d285601ba884ba2d1afa3e78b3f444.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/10d285601ba884ba2d1afa3e78b3f444.webm?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/10d285601ba884ba2d1afa3e78b3f444.mp4?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of <strong>Seth</strong>, god of the desert, on his quest to fight Apophis. In a game where Fast-FPS meets Rogue-Lite, battle waves of brutal enemies and ruthless bosses. <strong>Choose your weapon, fight, die, and rise again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/6007c7d2a5e10f96064b9cfe3b4e1dfa.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/6007c7d2a5e10f96064b9cfe3b4e1dfa.webm?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/6007c7d2a5e10f96064b9cfe3b4e1dfa.mp4?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/18201cf1c08a4e63f3445e2bfbeefd19.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/18201cf1c08a4e63f3445e2bfbeefd19.webp?t=1748078424\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span></h2></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into battle with a <strong>shield mechanic that encourages risk-taking</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay your foes, tear their soul apart from their body to replenish your shield and resist the most powerful attacks. But <strong>act quickly and stay close</strong> to them before they reach the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/08fc61e024dd3e11b2a5019351077e87.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/08fc61e024dd3e11b2a5019351077e87.webm?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/08fc61e024dd3e11b2a5019351077e87.mp4?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/7d8fc1cba4b2a5a4dd040bb7525a00b4.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/7d8fc1cba4b2a5a4dd040bb7525a00b4.webp?t=1748078424\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a selection of <strong>weapons with unique abilities</strong>, such as a slowdown for the bow or a grappling hook on your shotgun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them alongside your melee skills, dash, and spells to defeat your enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/56ffd9979ce7f429d205abf85df551a1.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/56ffd9979ce7f429d205abf85df551a1.webm?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/56ffd9979ce7f429d205abf85df551a1.mp4?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/9701a84dfa3bb33bb3efa4e5b0cbbd43.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/9701a84dfa3bb33bb3efa4e5b0cbbd43.webp?t=1748078424\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=100 /></picture></span>Each god have their own style. <strong>Receive their powers, combine them</strong> and make each one of your run unique. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between two runs, restore your divinity to become the feared god you used to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/10d285601ba884ba2d1afa3e78b3f444.poster.avif?t=1748078424\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/10d285601ba884ba2d1afa3e78b3f444.webm?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2647900/extras/10d285601ba884ba2d1afa3e78b3f444.mp4?t=1748078424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
